=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">6. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -33.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업 대상자 중에서 추가이수과정 이수자로 선발 되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">추가이수과정 이수 불가시 졸업할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -33.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적이 평점평균 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3.00</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이상 이어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">추가이수과정을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. 2010</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년도 이전에 수강한 과목은 이수구분 변경기간에 변경신청하시기 바람. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2011</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년도 이후 수강한 복수전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">부전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연계전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교직과정 이수구분은 포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 따라 자동 변경</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2018. 10.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">교무처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
